{"seq":2,"slug":"pcb-design","title":"PCB 设计","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design","rating":{"composite":4.03,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.18,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# PCB 设计\n\nPCB（Printed Circuit Board，印制电路板）设计是将电路原理图转化为可制造物理电路板的完整工程过程。从元器件选型与原理图绘制，到布局布线、信号完整性分析，再到制造工艺与测试验证，PCB 设计涵盖了电子产品从概念到量产的核心环节。\n\n本 Hub 系统梳理 PCB 设计的四大知识领域：原理图基础、布局布线、信号完整性与电源完整性、制造与测试。内容覆盖从入门级双层板到高速多层板（HDI）的设计方法论，结合 IPC 标准规范与 2026 年工业界最新实践。\n\n## 知识结构\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[PCB 设计] --> B[原理图基础]\n    A --> C[布局与布线]\n    A --> D[信号完整性]\n    A --> E[制造与测试]\n    B --> B1[元器件符号与封装]\n    B --> B2[绘制规范]\n    B --> B3[层次化设计]\n    C --> C1[布局原则]\n    C --> C2[走线与铜皮]\n    C --> C3[多层板设计]\n    D --> D1[阻抗控制]\n    D --> D2[高速信号走线]\n    D --> D3[电源完整性]\n    E --> E1[DFM 规范]\n    E --> E2[制造工艺]\n    E --> E3[测试与调试]\n```\n\n## 学习路径\n\n| 阶段     | 章节       | 核心能力                                     |\n| -------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 第一阶段 | 原理图基础 | 掌握元器件库管理、原理图规范绘制、层次化设计 |\n| 第二阶段 | 布局与布线 | 掌握组件放置策略、走线规则、多层板叠层       |\n| 第三阶段 | 信号完整性 | 理解阻抗匹配、串扰抑制、电源分配网络         |\n| 第四阶段 | 制造与测试 | 掌握 DFM/DFT 规范、工艺流程、调试方法        |\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基础电路分析（欧姆定律、KVL/KCL）\n- 电子元器件基础（电阻、电容、电感、半导体）\n- EDA 工具基本操作（KiCad / Altium Designer / Cadence）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"schematic-fundamentals","title":"原理图基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"component-symbols-footprints","title":"元器件符号与封装","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/component-symbols-footprints"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schematic-drawing-standards","title":"原理图绘制规范","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/schematic-drawing-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hierarchical-design","title":"层次化设计方法","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/hierarchical-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"layout-routing","title":"布局与布线","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pcb-layout-principles","title":"PCB 布局原则","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/pcb-layout-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-strategies-copper","title":"走线策略与铜皮","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/routing-strategies-copper"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multilayer-board-design","title":"多层板设计","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/multilayer-board-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"signal-integrity-pcb","title":"信号完整性与电源完整性","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"impedance-control","title":"阻抗控制","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/impedance-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"high-speed-signal-routing","title":"高速信号走线","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/high-speed-signal-routing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-integrity","title":"电源完整性","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/power-integrity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"manufacturing-testing","title":"制造与测试","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dfm-design-rules","title":"DFM 设计规范","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/dfm-design-rules"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pcb-manufacturing-process","title":"PCB 制造工艺","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/pcb-manufacturing-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-debugging-methods","title":"测试与调试方法","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/testing-debugging-methods"}]}]}